Fresh poster for 'Vision's Quest' featuring Paul Bettany and James Spader.

Alongside it, the release schedule for the miniseries was announced:
• Episodes 1 and 2 — October 14;
• Episodes 3 and 4 — October 21;
• Episodes 5 and 6 — October 28;
• Episode 7 — November 4;
• Episode 8 — November 11.

